Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.18,0:00:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The Princess Sapphire\NKnight of the Ribbon
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.00,0:00:50.16,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k72}{\k14}A{\k32}ta{\k40}shi {\k48}no {\k35}mi{\k52}ru {\k45}yu{\k34}me{\k30} {\k41}hi{\k44}mi{\k43}tsu {\k27}na{\k39}no{\k20}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.00,0:00:50.16,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,The dreams I see are my secret
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.25,0:00:57.09,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k53}{\k24}Da{\k13}re{\k25} {\k40}ni {\k36}mo {\k68}iwa{\k68}nai{\k56} {\k43}hi{\k40}mi{\k55}tsu {\k31}na{\k32}no
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.25,0:00:57.09,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,I won’t tell anyone—it’s my secret
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.54,0:01:02.46,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k27}{\k45}A{\k26}ka{\k22}i {\k43}man{\k19}to {\k40}hi{\k26}ra {\k23}hi{\k75}ra{\k46}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.54,0:01:02.46,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,A red cape fluttering
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.46,0:01:04.98,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k0}{\k12}U{\k25}ma {\k21}o {\k18}to{\k28}ba{\k15}su {\k91}ou{\k42}jo
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.46,0:01:04.98,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,Galloping on a horse—the princess
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.98,0:01:06.90,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k28}So{\k27}re {\k21}ga {\k15}a{\k12}{\k23}ta{\k31}shi{\k35}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.98,0:01:06.90,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,That’s me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.62,0:01:10.90,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k12}Lu{\k38}la{\k11} {\k20}du{\k10}la{\k19} {\k48}lu{\k53}la {\k43}du{\k40}la{\k22}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.91,0:01:13.42,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k23}{\k26}Lu{\k26}lu{\k13} {\k49}laa, {\k19}lu{\k40}laa{\k55}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.54,0:01:18.02,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k12}Lu{\k38}la{\k11} {\k20}du{\k10}la{\k19} {\k48}lu{\k53}la {\k43}du{\k40}la{\k22}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.14,0:01:20.74,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k23}{\k26}Lu{\k26}lu{\k13} {\k49}laa, {\k19}lu{\k40}laa{\k55}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.50,0:01:25.22,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k52}Ri{\k44}bon {\k38}no {\k35}ki{\k59}shi {\k115}wa{\k17}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.50,0:01:25.22,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,The Knight of the Ribbon,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.22,0:01:28.62,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k6}{\k50}Hon{\k43}to {\k33}wa {\k92}hon{\k43}tto {\k49}wa{\k24}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.22,0:01:28.62,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,Truly, truly,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.62,0:01:31.82,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k18}{\k23}A{\k23}ta{\k27}shi {\k35}na{\k35}no {\k159}sa{\k0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.62,0:01:31.82,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,It’s really me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.10,0:01:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Forty-Fifth Episode\NThe Ghost Ship\NTink and the Ghost Ship
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.06,0:02:25.96,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a ghost ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.00,0:02:58.17,Default,,0,0,0,,A ghost ship appeared?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.52,0:03:01.28,Default,,0,0,0,,That makes five ships sunk already.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.88,0:03:03.70,Default,,0,0,0,,What on earth is that ghost ship?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.08,0:03:07.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, according to a surviving sailor,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.18,0:03:09.88,Default,,0,0,0,,the one controlling the ghost ship was...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.97,0:03:12.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Wh-Who was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.48,0:03:15.99,Default,,0,0,0,,They say it's the notorious Blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.60,0:03:17.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Blood?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.00,0:03:20.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That Blood...?{\i0} Surely there must be some mistake!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.19,0:03:23.98,Default,,0,0,0,,There are eyewitnesses who saw him clearly.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.39,0:03:30.44,Default,,0,0,0,,So, there's no doubt the ghost ship is Blood's doing, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.14,0:03:33.38,Default,,0,0,0,,No, there is no mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.62,0:03:38.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I just can't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.11,0:03:41.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Blood saved me so many times.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.45,0:04:01.95,Default,,0,0,0,,He's rough-spoken, but I thought he was a kind person...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.76,0:04:05.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.93,0:04:08.52,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong? She seems so down.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.95,0:04:10.11,Default,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.94,0:04:13.26,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong? What were you thinking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.68,0:04:15.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, u-uh, it's nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.26,0:04:17.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on tight, we're speeding up!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.24,0:04:37.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, look at all those ships!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.41,0:04:52.41,Default,,0,0,0,,That must be the ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.43,0:04:53.25,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.72,0:04:58.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh-oh, this is bad! They found us!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.88,0:05:16.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Is anyone here?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.82,0:05:37.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Blood!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.90,0:05:40.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Sapphire.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.56,0:05:42.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew it was your ship, Blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.12,0:05:46.44,Default,,0,0,0,,But lounging around without posting a lookout is dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.33,0:05:51.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Without a lookout? Take a look behind you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.72,0:06:05.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.82,0:06:11.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm fine, I just lost my footing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.32,0:06:22.50,Default,,0,0,0,,The decoy plan was a success, wasn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.85,0:06:25.66,Default,,0,0,0,,As if I'd let them uncover our secret so easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.21,0:06:30.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Exactly. Once that plan succeeds, Silverland will...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.38,0:06:36.34,Default,,0,0,0,,This is no laughing matter, Blood!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.88,0:06:37.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Back off, Sapphire.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.00,0:06:39.60,Default,,0,0,0,,If we were a ghost ship,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.62,0:06:42.32,Default,,0,0,0,,there's no way we'd openly sail right into your port, would we?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.00,0:06:45.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides, there are plenty of servants.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.87,0:06:48.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Even as we speak, the army might come to capture you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.78,0:06:50.08,Default,,0,0,0,,No need to worry about that, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.52,0:06:51.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.50,0:06:56.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.45,0:07:03.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Unbelievable... When on earth did this happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.50,0:07:07.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, lower the boat for them!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.49,0:07:08.27,Default,,0,0,0,,A boat?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.40,0:07:11.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Get the sturdiest boat so we can reach the harbor safely.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.28,0:07:13.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, Blood. I'm not going back.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.38,0:07:17.47,Default,,0,0,0,,If we defeat the ghost ship with this vessel,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.50,0:07:19.28,Default,,0,0,0,,we can prove your innocence too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.12,0:07:21.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Not a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.08,0:07:22.40,Default,,0,0,0,,The sea is a man's world.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.42,0:07:24.34,Default,,0,0,0,, Women only defile it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.37,0:07:25.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, boys?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.22,0:07:26.22,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.36,0:07:29.01,Default,,0,0,0,,You're just trying to cover yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.03,0:07:30.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I am never going back!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.81,0:07:31.90,Default,,0,0,0,,When I tell you to leave, leave!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.04,0:07:34.53,Default,,0,0,0,,When I say I'm not going back, I'm not going back!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.53,0:07:36.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Got it, Sapphire.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.59,0:07:39.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Just don't come whining about it later.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.91,0:07:40.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave it to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.89,0:07:43.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't lose to anyone when it comes to work on a ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.67,0:07:44.55,Default,,0,0,0,,You hear that, boys?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.57,0:07:45.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't hold back!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.68,0:07:46.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Work him hard!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.97,0:07:47.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Real hard!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.80,0:07:49.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.64,0:07:55.52,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, rookie, get to work! First up, laundry!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.60,0:07:59.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course! When that's done, we raise a toast!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.24,0:08:02.83,Default,,0,0,0,,No time to sit around. What's next?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.05,0:08:05.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Make the special, then polish the mast!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.88,0:08:11.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! Hyah! Hyah!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.95,0:08:14.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out of the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.25,0:08:19.13,Default,,0,0,0,,What should I do next, Gramps?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.47,0:08:21.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Polish the mast!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.28,0:08:22.50,Default,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.24,0:08:47.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain, I can't compete with him!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.44,0:08:50.65,Default,,0,0,0,,He cooks every day and pulls a full workload.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.67,0:08:55.71,Default,,0,0,0,,That's for sure. And I've never seen such an attentive deckhand.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.15,0:09:16.29,Default,,0,0,0,,All I see is ocean.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.31,0:09:18.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Silverland is so far away now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.98,0:09:34.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Father, Mother... I wonder how you're doing right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.90,0:09:37.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure they're worrying about you since you're not there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.22,0:09:40.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You did great out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.59,0:09:42.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like everyone has a new respect for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.32,0:09:42.95,Default,,0,0,0,,How rude!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.97,0:09:44.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Barging in without knocking!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.61,0:09:49.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I did knock. You were just daydreaming and didn't notice.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.90,0:09:53.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Instead of worrying about me, why don't you go find that ghost ship?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.44,0:09:55.16,Default,,0,0,0,,We will.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.14,0:09:59.17,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll track it down and teach them a sailor's lesson.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.53,0:10:00.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave it to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.41,0:10:02.77,Default,,0,0,0,,A ghost ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.34,0:10:04.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Blood!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.77,0:10:19.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Blood, if we bring the ship closer...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.55,0:10:21.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, that's dangerous! We should scout in a boat...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.01,0:10:26.39,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, lower the boats! Captain Blood here will take you sightseeing on a ghost ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.80,0:10:29.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Lower away!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.82,0:10:46.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm scared!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.19,0:10:47.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.87,0:10:49.72,Default,,0,0,0,,That's just St. Elmo's fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.74,0:10:51.72,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just atmospheric electricity clinging to the mast.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.08,0:11:00.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Is anyone here?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.72,0:11:04.00,Default,,0,0,0,,If nobody's there, at least answer and say so!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.14,0:11:08.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Anything unusual?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.24,0:11:09.24,Default,,0,0,0,,N-No, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.69,0:11:12.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like this was just a shipwreck after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.80,0:11:15.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, everyone! Pull back!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.50,0:11:16.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Hooray!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.57,0:11:17.77,Default,,0,0,0,,What a letdown.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.28,0:11:31.03,Default,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.61,0:11:35.02,Default,,0,0,0,,How scary!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.06,0:11:43.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I-I-It's disgusting!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.62,0:11:54.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Fancy meeting you in a place like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.11,0:11:59.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Y-You...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.84,0:12:01.73,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right, I'm a fake sailor!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.75,0:12:03.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that you've discovered the secret down here in the hold,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.93,0:12:05.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't just let you leave in one piece!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.34,0:12:06.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Show yourselves!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.51,0:12:16.13,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't go back now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.15,0:12:19.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You're coming to our home, Hell Island!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.04,0:12:20.89,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right Hell Island!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.97,0:12:27.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.09,0:12:30.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry up, or I'll leave you behind!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.25,0:12:37.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, Bosun, have you seen Tink?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.97,0:12:41.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, couldn't he be on that boat that left earlier?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.52,0:12:45.89,Default,,0,0,0,,We checked everywhere, but he wasn't there.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.16,0:12:47.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Good work. All right, pull back.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.98,0:13:03.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.23,0:13:04.91,Default,,0,0,0,,We've been set up!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.99,0:13:05.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Blast it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.11,0:13:08.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Look out! Incoming!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.34,0:13:32.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Set the sails! Hard to port!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.92,0:13:42.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Prepare to attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.42,0:13:45.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Gunners, take aim!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.92,0:14:05.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Gramps!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.40,0:14:10.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Put an end to this once and for all, Sapphire.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.07,0:14:12.73,Default,,0,0,0,,The ghost ship... destroy the ghost ship...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.67,0:14:17.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Blood...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.66,0:14:20.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.82,0:14:32.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Blood, amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.49,0:14:36.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain! The ghost ship is getting away!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.57,0:14:37.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Pursue it at once!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.81,0:14:47.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll pay you back double for this!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.48,0:14:49.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Count on it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.36,0:15:20.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Here's that rum you loved so much. Giving you the good stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.80,0:15:24.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodbye, Gramps!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.80,0:15:46.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Still no sign of the ghost ship?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.50,0:15:49.91,Default,,0,0,0,,No, sir. Just a seagull flying around.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.47,0:15:56.47,Default,,0,0,0,,A letter...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.82,0:16:04.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I got captured by the ghost ship.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.35,0:16:11.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And I was brought to an island called Hell Island.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.70,0:16:15.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}This place is truly terrifying.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.00,0:16:22.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}There are so many guards, even a shark couldn't get close.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.68,0:16:44.07,Default,,0,0,0,,All right! Test the ghost battery!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.12,0:16:52.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Stay away from this cove.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.47,0:16:56.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Please deliver this letter to Sapphire.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.14,0:16:58.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Hell Island?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.03,0:16:59.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that their base?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.96,0:17:00.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You know it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.82,0:17:01.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.61,0:17:03.55,Default,,0,0,0,,There's only one cove ships can enter,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.57,0:17:05.18,Default,,0,0,0,,and the rest is surrounded by cliffs.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.21,0:17:06.96,Default,,0,0,0,,A perfect hideout for villains.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.27,0:17:10.85,Default,,0,0,0,,And you're framing me for the ghost ship just because I know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.91,0:17:13.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait! There's something else written here!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.85,0:17:16.08,Default,,0,0,0,,What? The bosun is a spy?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.54,0:17:28.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks to you, I will live to see another day.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.95,0:17:31.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Hell Island is a volcanic island.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.61,0:17:33.42,Default,,0,0,0,,The surrounding sea is boiling from the heat.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.86,0:17:35.24,Default,,0,0,0,,The back of the island is a massive cliff.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.72,0:17:37.00,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll land from there.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.47,0:17:39.80,Default,,0,0,0,,We won't win this fight unless we outsmart them.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.34,0:17:41.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Got it, everyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.16,0:18:01.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, watch out! Hold onto me, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.24,0:18:10.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Follow me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.57,0:18:26.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire! Don't look down!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.39,0:18:30.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Guards!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.11,0:18:32.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay quiet so they don't spot us!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.35,0:19:04.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks to your cooperation, the Ghost Ship Plan is progressing steadily.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.87,0:19:07.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Tonight, let's celebrate the bright future of Grand Duke Duralumin,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.35,0:19:09.25,Default,,0,0,0,,who carried out this plan!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.69,0:19:12.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Party hard, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.35,0:19:23.97,Default,,0,0,0,,A party in the Haunted Hall?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.26,0:19:26.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll send every last one of you straight to hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.25,0:19:34.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.40,0:19:40.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Get him!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.98,0:20:02.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire! After him!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.94,0:20:07.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll handle these guys! Don't let him get away!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.37,0:20:21.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll show 'em!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.08,0:20:46.01,Default,,0,0,0,,The boss was beaten! Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.91,0:20:48.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't back down! Get them!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.30,0:21:02.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Blood! It's a huge victory! We won!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.96,0:21:04.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Blood?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.45,0:21:11.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You finally did it? This completely clears me of suspicion.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.47,0:21:13.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on, Blood!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.94,0:21:16.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.61,0:21:20.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.99,0:21:25.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink, thanks to your letter, we avenged everyone. You did great.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.55,0:21:27.81,Default,,0,0,0,,But Blood, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.91,0:21:29.15,Default,,0,0,0,,No need to worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.39,0:21:32.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm invincible.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.99,0:21:53.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.73,0:21:54.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Go home right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.70,0:21:58.60,Default,,0,0,0,,My men will take you back on the ghost ship we captured.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.87,0:22:03.23,Default,,0,0,0,,But Blood, I'm still worried about your injuries!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.40,0:22:06.32,Default,,0,0,0,,As you can see, I'm perfectly fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.72,0:22:08.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You need to hurry back home and
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.35,0:22:12.62,Default,,0,0,0,,crush the villains' next evil plans! Got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.50,0:22:15.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Now hurry up and go!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.29,0:22:18.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Blood!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.57,0:22:21.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}He got terribly hurt for my sake...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.65,0:22:23.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Will he really be okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.98,0:22:31.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Set sail!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.67,0:22:36.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Way to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.93,0:22:38.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Quite a swordsman, isn't she?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.51,0:22:43.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you all right, Captain?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.36,0:22:44.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Bah, this is nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.58,0:22:50.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.90,0:23:01.22,Default,,0,0,0,,He's gruff and stubborn, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.40,0:23:03.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}...kind Captain Blood.{\i0}
